      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>A hideous bird that uses its stout beak to vent its frustrations. A distant cousin of the cockatrice with an extra 'bite'.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 18, touch 16; flat-footed 13 (+4 dex, +1 dodge, +2 natural, +1 size)</p><p>hp 45 [77] (7d10+7)</p><p>Fort +6, Ref +9, Will +4</p><p>Immune Petrification/Statue and Burn</p><p>Resist Fire 5, ice3 50%</p><p>Weakness Water</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 20 ft.; Fly 60 ft. (poor)</p><p>Melee Bite +12 (1d6+2)</p><p>Special Abilities Petrify</p><p>Special Attacks Critical Attack, Fireflash, Tail Fling</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 14, Dex 19, Con 12, Int 2, Wis 14, Cha 8</p><p>Base Atk +7; CMB +8; CMD 22</p><p>Feats Ability Focus (Petrify), Dodge, Improved Natural Attack (bite), Weapon Finesse</p><p>Skills Fly +8, Perception +10</p>"
